@prefix :     <https://w3id.org/spatial-cognition#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:CoordinateFrame a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Coordinate frame"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A local coordinate system set up by a transform-bearing node and its ancestors. X3D frames are right-handed, with +Y up and a default view along -Z; units are meters unless a unit statement says otherwise."@en .
